- That day...?

273
00:18:27,792 --> 00:18:29,750
Here on the right side of
Ambrosia Pub's entrance.

274
00:18:30,167 --> 00:18:31,958
You wait till Dad comes.

275
00:18:32,125 --> 00:18:32,999
That's better.

276
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:33,999
I'll take care of it.

277
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,417
