What do you want to do?

295
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:42,417
I'm aspiring to take up Civil services.

296
00:19:43,292 --> 00:19:44,541
I'm preparing for that.

297
00:19:44,542 --> 00:19:46,042
[in unison] Civils...

298
00:19:46,833 --> 00:19:48,457
Civils. Very nice decision.

299
00:19:48,458 --> 00:19:50,667
- Chaitra, all the best.
- [in unison] Yeah, all the best.

300
00:19:52,208 --> 00:19:53,208
Four guys,

301
