no, no...

302
00:19:56,792 --> 00:19:57,958
Five guys.

303
00:19:58,625 --> 00:20:00,458
No, no. Five guys.

304
00:20:05,083 --> 00:20:06,083
Four of them...

305
00:20:08,833 --> 00:20:10,875
Brother. Pack six of them.

306
00:20:19,250 --> 00:20:20,333
- Thank you, sir.
- Thank you.

307
00:20:22,583 --> 00:20:23,832
They switched two cars.

308
00:20:23,833 --> 00:20:25,458
This car's out of petrol, Chaitra.

309
00:20:26,042 --> 00:20:28,083
That's our friend's car.
I'll drop you off.

310
00:20:29,250 --> 00:20:30,375
- Come on.
- Yeah, come on.

311
00:20:33,125 --> 00:20:34,542
Five guys.

312
00:20:34,833 --> 00:20:35,792
Hi.

313
00:20:36,417 --> 00:20:37,792
They switched two cars.

314
00:20:43,667 --> 00:20:46,250
Five guys?
What happened, dear?

315
00:20:47,542 --> 00:20:48,458
Please tell me, dear.

316
00:20:48,833 --> 00:20:50,166
