317
00:20:50,167 --> 00:20:52,124
- Chaitra, we are all just 17.
- Yeah.

318
00:20:52,125 --> 00:20:53,208
- Yeah.
- Me, too.

319
00:20:56,583 --> 00:20:59,875
We may be younger,
but we're experts in all.

320
00:21:00,250 --> 00:21:01,333
What happened, dear?

321
00:21:02,250 --> 00:21:03,374
Please don't do that.

322
00:21:03,375 --> 00:21:04,708
I don't like this kind of stuff.

323
00:21:04,833 --> 00:21:05,749
Chaitra, it's okay.

324
00:21:05,750 --> 00:21:07,916
- Why are you worrying?
- I'm saying I'm not comfortable.

325
00:21:07,917 --> 00:21:09,125
Chaitra, it's fine.

326
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:12,792
I don't like this kind of stuff.

327
00:21:14,042 --> 00:21:15,875
They stuffed tissue papers in my mouth.

328
00:21:16,792 --> 00:21:18,583
- I'm afraid.
- It's okay.

329
00:21:18,708 --> 00:21:20,292
I have a trick to make
your fear disappear.

330
00:21:20,500 --> 00:21:21,458
Will you see?

331
