Hey!

332
00:21:23,625 --> 00:21:24,625
Behave yourself.

333
00:21:24,833 --> 00:21:26,208
Chaitra, relax.

334
00:21:26,417 --> 00:21:27,833
- I'm saying no.
- It's okay.

335
00:21:28,083 --> 00:21:29,542
