I thought they are friends--
No.

344
00:21:49,083 --> 00:21:50,792
They are monsters, Mom.

345
00:21:58,958 --> 00:21:59,917
Please get up, dear.

346
00:22:04,500 --> 00:22:05,417
Please come, dear.

347
00:22:06,833 --> 00:22:09,833
Five of them? What happened, dear?

348
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:12,250
I thought they are friends...

349
00:22:13,417 --> 00:22:14,542
No!

350
00:22:16,083 --> 00:22:17,708
They are monsters.

351
00:22:29,375 --> 00:22:30,500
Hey, pass me the joint.

352
00:22:30,750 --> 00:22:31,667
Have it.

353
00:23:14,500 --> 00:23:16,292
Oh my God.

354
00:23:19,042 --> 00:23:21,458
What a terrible tragedy!

355
00:23:22,750 --> 00:23:26,458
Not even one or two...
five monsters.

356
00:23:29,500 --> 00:23:31,208
Dad, control yourself.

357
00:23:35,750 --> 00:23:37,042
Who are these boys?

358
00:23:39,708 --> 00:23:42,625
I'll kill those monsters right now.

359
00:23:44,417 --> 00:23:46,750
God! What should we do now?

360
00:23:48,042 --> 00:23:50,417
What can we do now?

361
00:23:51,917 --> 00:23:53,333
What do we do now?

362
00:23:53,792 --> 00:23:56,583
Let's take her to the doctor first.

363
00:24:11,917 --> 00:24:12,750
Dear...

364
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:14,792
Let's go to the police station first.

365
00:24:15,500 --> 00:24:16,708
Police station, dear?

366
00:24:17,292 --> 00:24:19,792
- Police station--
- Why should we fear, Dad?

367
00:24:21,167 --> 00:24:22,458
What wrong did we do?

368
