Do you mean that girls shouldn't
go to pubs and parties, Dad?

369
00:24:28,917 --> 00:24:31,375
Shouldn't girls speak out
even after going through all this, Dad?

370
00:24:31,792 --> 00:24:33,083
Let's ask them the same thing, Dad.

371
00:24:35,875 --> 00:24:36,792
Euphoria.

372
00:24:38,250 --> 00:24:39,208
Is it the same?

373
00:24:39,667 --> 00:24:40,792
The event's name.

374
00:24:42,042 --> 00:24:43,750
Please tell me, dear.
You don't have to fear anything.

375
00:24:44,375 --> 00:24:49,125
Even the laws are now tougher
on violators.

376
00:24:49,583 --> 00:24:50,667
Their chapter ends here.

377
00:24:51,458 --> 00:24:52,625
Please speak without fear.

378
00:24:53,167 --> 00:24:54,083
Wherever they are,

379
00:24:54,208 --> 00:24:56,167
I'll put them behind bars by tonight.

380
00:24:58,042 --> 00:24:59,042
Please tell me, dear.

381
00:25:03,708 --> 00:25:06,042
- That day--
- That day, good ...

382
00:25:06,417 --> 00:25:07,333
Go on.

383
00:25:10,292 --> 00:25:11,208
That day...

384
00:25:12,292 --> 00:25:13,292
Come on.

385
00:25:14,792 --> 00:25:15,708
Okay.

386
00:25:15,833 --> 00:25:16,833
Okay.

387
00:25:16,958 --> 00:25:18,833
It's okay.

388
00:25:20,208 --> 00:25:21,792
We shouldn't force her, sir.

389
00:25:23,167 --> 00:25:24,125
She is still in...

390
00:25:25,250 --> 00:25:27,000
post-trauma stage.

391
00:25:27,625 --> 00:25:29,042
She will tell us when she wants to.

392
00:25:30,500 --> 00:25:31,750
The one who is in this stage,

393
00:25:31,917 --> 00:25:32,999
should be given adequate support,

394
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:35,500
and also there is a center that
can help them speak.

395
00:25:36,833 --> 00:25:37,708
Let's send her there.

396
00:25:39,292 --> 00:25:40,208
What's that center about?

397
00:25:40,625 --> 00:25:41,458
Bharosa!

398
00:25:58,375 --> 00:26:00,833
- Ma'am. Jubilee hills family is here.
- Send them in.

399
00:26:17,833 --> 00:26:19,542
I heard that you're preparing
for Civils, right?

400
00:26:20,250 --> 00:26:21,250
All the best, dear.

401
00:26:21,625 --> 00:26:23,792
I was aspiring
to become a Collector too.

402
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:25,417
But I'm a bit slow.

403
00:26:26,167 --> 00:26:28,667
So, I joined the job I landed

404
00:26:29,042 --> 00:26:30,833
and continuing with my preparation.

405
00:26:31,125 --> 00:26:33,167
You're very adorable.

406
00:26:33,750 --> 00:26:37,167
I'm thinking of all the young
aspirants and new Collectors.

407
00:26:37,667 --> 00:26:38,917
Smitha Sabharwal, ma'am.

408
00:26:39,292 --> 00:26:40,500
Amrapali, ma'am.

409
00:26:41,375 --> 00:26:42,458
Very soon,

410
00:26:43,792 --> 00:26:44,708
Chaitra, ma'am.

411
00:26:47,125 --> 00:26:48,125
Have it.

412
00:26:52,583 --> 00:26:53,917
Please have it.

413
00:27:02,292 --> 00:27:05,000
On May 28th, at 1 p.m.,

414
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:08,583
my friend Deepthi and I attend the
Euphoria event,

415
00:27:08,875 --> 00:27:11,750
at Ambrosia pub in Jubilee Hills.

416
00:27:12,208 --> 00:27:16,125
I got introduced to Vikas
and four of his friends.

417
00:27:59,208 --> 00:28:02,417
Based on the registration numbers
trace the addresses immediately.

418
00:28:02,833 --> 00:28:03,750
Okay?

419
00:28:27,333 --> 00:28:28,333
Let's go.

420
00:28:42,917 --> 00:28:44,333
- Good morning, sir.
- Yeah. Morning.

421
00:28:45,333 --> 00:28:46,250
Please sit.

422
00:28:52,208 --> 00:28:53,042
Sir.

423
00:28:53,500 --> 00:28:55,625
The kind of stuff happening
in clubs and pubs?

424
00:28:55,833 --> 00:28:58,542
Way more than what we hear
from ration shops!

425
00:28:58,792 --> 00:28:59,917
Aren't you preventing them?

426
00:29:00,292 --> 00:29:04,124
Why isn't the license of Ambrosia pub
suspended yet?

427
00:29:04,125 --> 00:29:06,166
What is the police system doing about

428
00:29:06,167 --> 00:29:07,833
