of crimes against women?

429
00:29:08,042 --> 00:29:09,958
What preventive measures
are the police taking?

430
00:29:10,375 --> 00:29:12,875
Sir, the rate of minor crimes
is increasing day by day.

431
00:29:13,125 --> 00:29:15,167
What is take of the
police department on it?

432
00:29:15,792 --> 00:29:17,916
Sir. It's been three days since
the incident occurred,

433
00:29:17,917 --> 00:29:19,375
what's the reason for calling
the press meet now, sir?

434
00:29:19,500 --> 00:29:21,624
I'm sure you handled everything quietly,
behind the scenes

435
00:29:21,625 --> 00:29:23,166
What new thing would you say now?

436
00:29:23,167 --> 00:29:25,750
The law will do its job, right?

437
00:29:26,083 --> 00:29:28,750
The guys are from wealthy families.
Am I right, sir?

438
00:29:28,875 --> 00:29:30,792
Is the girl alive or dead, sir?

439
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:33,000
What's there to say now?

440
00:29:33,167 --> 00:29:34,208
You said everything.

441
00:29:34,333 --> 00:29:36,250
Whatever I say now will seem
like a routine speech.

442
00:29:38,042 --> 00:29:41,208
See, the problem is you need sensation.

443
00:29:42,292 --> 00:29:44,250
You won't be interested
if it's not there.

444
00:29:44,583 --> 00:29:48,042
How long would that interest stay?
Only when the news is hot and fresh.

445
00:29:49,083 --> 00:29:52,750
What I would say now is,
the law will do its job.

446
00:29:53,292 --> 00:29:55,000
Since these are the usual lines,

447
00:29:55,500 --> 00:29:57,083
