531
00:37:09,625 --> 00:37:12,417
On top of that, he was deep
into illegal activities.

532
00:37:12,750 --> 00:37:14,458
He's killed four people so far.

533
00:37:14,708 --> 00:37:18,583
And he's loving the ‘psycho Sahil' label
society gave him.

534
00:37:18,917 --> 00:37:21,250
But what's the connection
between that case and this one?

535
00:37:22,125 --> 00:37:23,333
That's exactly what I'm coming to.

536
00:37:23,708 --> 00:37:25,792
The Punjagutta accident back then...

537
00:37:26,250 --> 00:37:28,667
and the Ambrosia Pub case now...

538
00:37:29,167 --> 00:37:30,667
The common point between them...

539
00:37:31,125 --> 00:37:31,958
Minors.

540
00:37:33,667 --> 00:37:34,667
Across the country...

541
00:37:34,833 --> 00:37:38,375
last year, 30% of the accused were minors.

542
00:37:38,583 --> 00:37:39,583
And this year...

543
00:37:39,792 --> 00:37:41,000
in just the first three months

544
00:37:41,125 --> 00:37:42,583
it's already reached 32%.

545
00:37:43,083 --> 00:37:44,333
If this keeps rising...

546
00:37:44,875 --> 00:37:48,500
I don't need to spell out
how serious the problem is.

547
00:37:49,500 --> 00:37:50,667
At the root level...

548
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:52,792
we need to tackle this.

549
00:37:54,250 --> 00:37:55,208
So in this case...

550
00:37:55,750 --> 00:37:57,083
Even if the accused are minors...

551
00:37:57,750 --> 00:37:58,667
In my opinion...

552
00:37:59,000 --> 00:37:59,917
in this case

553
00:38:00,167 --> 00:38:01,292
the real culprits

554
00:38:01,625 --> 00:38:03,167
if you ask me...

555
00:38:07,708 --> 00:38:08,625
It's the parents.

556
00:38:12,625 --> 00:38:14,083
How exactly are the parents responsible?

557
00:38:14,708 --> 00:38:15,667
Yes.

558
00:38:16,500 --> 00:38:17,500
It's the parents...

559
00:38:17,750 --> 00:38:19,792
who raised them,
without any responsibility.

560
00:38:20,042 --> 00:38:21,083
They're the first culprits.

561
00:38:22,750 --> 00:38:25,833
Lack of proper parenting
is the root of all this.

562
00:38:26,792 --> 00:38:28,542
Because they're minors...

563
