we can't even call them "accused".

564
00:38:32,333 --> 00:38:33,249
They're CCLs.

565
00:38:33,250 --> 00:38:35,166
Children in Conflict with Law.

566
00:38:35,167 --> 00:38:37,417
We're not allowed to reveal their names.

567
00:38:37,833 --> 00:38:39,500
But the parents who raised them...

568
00:38:39,875 --> 00:38:42,667
should be held fully accountable.

569
00:38:43,000 --> 00:38:46,666
