their identities publicly.

570
00:38:46,667 --> 00:38:50,208
So? You'll expose the names of VIPs?

571
00:38:50,542 --> 00:38:54,917
Yes. And I'm ready
to face any consequence.

572
00:38:56,958 --> 00:39:00,833
This isn't just on the kids
who committed the crime.

573
00:39:01,333 --> 00:39:02,667
Their parents are answerable too.

574
